   427	## 6. (G-A) Alexander / Libgober, honestly
   428	
   429	Computed anyway, as charged, on the Reidemeister–Schreier presentation of
   430	`H` (`N + 1 = 9` generators, `N = 8` relators, deficiency 1 — consistent
   431	with `chi(Sigma_H) = 0`), by exact Fox calculus over
   432	`Z[H^ab] = Z[t_1^{±1},...,t_j^{±1}]`, with `Delta_1 = gcd` of the `9`
   433	maximal minors. MEASURED, up to units and up to the `GL_j(Z)` ambiguity of
   434	the coordinates on `H^ab`:
   435	
   436	```text
   437	cell (2,3), 16 records :  Delta_1  =  Phi_3(u) = u^2 + u + 1
   438	cell (3,2),  6 records :  Delta_1  =  Phi_3(u)
   439	cell (3,4),  6 records :  Delta_1  =  (u - 1) * Phi_3(u)^2
   440	cell (4,3),  4 records :  Delta_1  =  (u - 1) * Phi_3(u)^2
   441	        in every case  u = t^v  for a single primitive  v in Z^j .
   442	```
   443	
   444	What this can and cannot do:
   445	
   446	* The charged divisibility — `Delta` divides the product of the local
   447	  Alexander polynomials at the singular points times `Delta_infty` — has
   448	  an **empty local factor** here, because `E` is smooth (§2). So the
   449	  charged form of (G-A) degenerates to `Delta_1 | Delta_infty`, and the
   450	  record pins nothing about `K_infty` (§3). **(G-A) as charged is not
   451	  decidable on the record.** It is not needed: Chains I and II both close
