   521	   `j = 2` disjoint components forces `{chi(E_1), chi(E_2)} = {1, 0}`
   522	   (each `<= 1`, integers, sum `1`), so `E_1 =~ A^1` and `E_2` is a smooth
   523	   affine curve with `2g+theta = 2`, i.e. `theta = 2, g = 0`. The `A^1`
   524	   component must map non-constantly to `A_F \ {c} =~ C^*`: impossible.
