   122	> **THEOREM NO-PUSHFORWARD.** Let `phi : Gamma -> G` be a homomorphism,
   123	> `rho : G -> S_N` transitive, `H := rho^{-1}(Stab_1)`,
   124	> `Lambda := (rho ∘ phi)^{-1}(Stab_1)`.
