   126	> (i) If `phi` is **surjective**, then `phi(Lambda) = H` and
   127	> `Lambda^{ab} ↠ H^{ab}`. Torsion in `Lambda^{ab}` therefore *constrains*
   128	> `H^{ab}` only by being killable: a quotient of a group with torsion
