./xmodel/domrina-1999-audit-sol56-20260901.log:79510:./xmodel/ideation-20260831T1033Z-grok46.md:133:with each inner summand nonnegative (Cor. 4.3). Theorem 10.1 plus `H_inertia` charges at least one owner dicritical with `mu >= 2`. The *remainder* `3 - mu_owner` is therefore in `{0,1}` and is a numerical invariant of the unique branch. Domrina–Orevkov (one dicritical component) and Domrina, Izv. Math. 64 (2000) (two dicritical components) already classified the number of *dicritical compactification components* for `N=4`; that number is 1 or 2 and is *not* `m`. Flag/place/series: dicritical component, `A_F` component, and cover-cycle type stay distinct. The remainder is a count of multiplicities on compactification divisors mapping onto `B`, not a count of places of `B`.
