./xmodel/ideation-significant-news-20260826T1740Z-codex.md:65:The total-Rees object should map every DVR arc to a finite support state. The needed result is not coverage of one coordinate model but properness/valuative completeness of this state map, with every closed specialization landing in a registered successor. A practical certificate is a finite fan with two-sided specialization maps and compatible obstruction functionals on every codimension-one wall.
./xmodel/ideation-significant-news-20260826T1740Z-codex.md:170:Other live approaches remain scientifically available but should receive no AWS allocation without a concrete invariant and negative control: D-module, motivic/K-theory, free/noncommutative, Markus-Yamabe, differential-Galois, Ritt, ML/cancellation, and generic tropical programs. Zheglov/DC auditing is defensive scholarship, not a resolution lane. A(F)/Abhyankar-Moh becomes attractive only after a book produces an actual asymptotic component and its place semigroup.
