./xmodel/web-sweep-20260902-grok46.md:54:## 2. Dicritical divisors and non-properness sets (post-2020)
./xmodel/web-sweep-20260902-grok46.md:56:Target: post-2020 dicriticals of polynomial maps \(\mathbb{A}^2\to\mathbb{A}^2\), Jelonek non-properness sets, Domrina–Orevkov-style low-degree classifications. Bearing on `OPEN[RESIDUAL-TO-DOMRINA-STATE]` and the one-cusp horn (local dicritical picture at infinity).
