./xmodel/bd-a2-normal-singular-reduced-finite-f5-bridge-hostile-review-gpt55-20260830.log:4177:xmodel/websweep-0823.log:6480:-| EC-K3-H3-D13-MW17-LATTICE-CHAIN | Exact eleven-step nef degree-two H3 lattice chain from D13/MW4 to rootless/MW17 | Starting from the exact D13/MW4 frame of EC-K3-H3-Q8-QQ-D13, eleven stored primitive integral U-neighbours with q-sequence (24,6,8,4,4,4,4,4,4,4,6) give D12/MW5, A11/MW6, 2A5/MW7, 3A3/MW8, A3+2A2/MW10, 5A1/MW12, 4A1/MW13, 3A1/MW14, 2A1/MW15, A1/MW16, and finally a rootless MW17 frame. Every factor presentation has old-fibre degree two. Independent reconstruction from the pinned witnesses checks every child Gram matrix and a determinant-one composite transport. Exact chamber checkers prove all eleven selected classes nef using finite-component degrees, full-frame closest-vector calculations, and the degree-two bisection parity identity. The final q6 witness comes from a bounded search, but the displayed witness, child, and nefness are exact; no exhaustive q4 or global minimal-q claim is made. This certifies the complete lattice/chamber chain only. The eleven equation-level characteristic-zero pencils after D13/MW4, transported sections, and specialization to curve 273 remain open. | [source](elliptic-curves/notes/ICARM_CURVE273_CONSTRUCTION_INVESTIGATION.md) | `EC-K3-H3-Q8-QQ-D13` | [checker](elkies-k3/scripts/verify_h3_d13_to_mw17_path.sage) | exact_symbolic; `sha256:3a3a1b51553c…`; locks: `elkies-k3/scripts/exact_neighbor_engine.sage`, `elkies-k3/scripts/analyze_h3_d13_q4_chamber.sage`, `elkies-k3/scripts/analyze_h3_rank_growing_degree2_chain.sage`, `elkies-k3/scripts/analyze_h3_mw10_to_rootless_chambers.sage`, `elkies-k3/scripts/verify_h3_d13_to_mw17_path.sage`, `artifacts/generated-results/elkies-k3-h3-d13-to-mw17-path.json`; updates: narrows problems `OP-EC-NEXT`; consumers `REPRODUCE.md`, `elkies-k3/KUMAR_E7E8_BACKTRACK.md`, `elliptic-curves/notes/ICARM_CURVE273_CONSTRUCTION_INVESTIGATION.md` | — |
