+## 9. Chain II
+
+Chain II begins with the setup `CUSP:236-262`. The HT substrate supplies
+`G=G_{p,q}`, central `z=alpha^p`, `H=rho^{-1}(Stab_1)`, `H_1(Y)=Z^j`, and
+`N=M kappa` (`HT:358-365`). HT also supplies ORBIFOLD-CAGE and the formula
